    "name": "Dweller",
    "steam_appid": 2871090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.poster.avif?t=1754644883\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.webm?t=1754644883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.mp4?t=1754644883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dweller is a first-person psychological-survival horror experience set in the decaying sewer systems beneath an abandoned city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the newest recruit of the City Maintenance Division, sent into the sealed tunnels. Armed only with a dim headlamp and a radio, you enter alone. There are no maps, no backup, and no clear answers. The tools you need lie somewhere in the darkness, if you can find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate rusted corridors and flooded chambers, it becomes clear these tunnels hold more than abandoned infrastructure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice crackles through your radio, watching and guiding you while hiding true intentions. They know your name and your location, but they are not here to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now there's no way back. Only down.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/4841f905e2452b58bc581c36312e2e6b.avif?t=1754644883\" width=616 height=162 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Claustrophobic Underground World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected sewer system filled with sewage, hidden passageways, and environmental storytelling that reveals the city\u2019s buried secrets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies That Hunt You</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something stalks the tunnels. Evade it, hide from it, or fight back with improvised weapons. Every noise could be your last.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Psychological Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares, just relentless dread and deadly encounters. The deeper you go, the more your senses fail, your gear falters, your mind fractures\u2026 and terrifying enemies close in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/58c0afb73e1878f1ea7a0fe50cbc3924.avif?t=1754644883\" width=616 height=162 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.poster.avif?t=1754644883\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.webm?t=1754644883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/c1898ce3992dfa20577b38de6d30e257.mp4?t=1754644883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dweller is a first-person psychological-survival horror experience set in the decaying sewer systems beneath an abandoned city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the newest recruit of the City Maintenance Division, sent into the sealed tunnels. Armed only with a dim headlamp and a radio, you enter alone. There are no maps, no backup, and no clear answers. The tools you need lie somewhere in the darkness, if you can find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate rusted corridors and flooded chambers, it becomes clear these tunnels hold more than abandoned infrastructure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice crackles through your radio, watching and guiding you while hiding true intentions. They know your name and your location, but they are not here to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now there's no way back. Only down.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/4841f905e2452b58bc581c36312e2e6b.avif?t=1754644883\" width=616 height=162 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Claustrophobic Underground World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected sewer system filled with sewage, hidden passageways, and environmental storytelling that reveals the city\u2019s buried secrets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies That Hunt You</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something stalks the tunnels. Evade it, hide from it, or fight back with improvised weapons. Every noise could be your last.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Psychological Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares, just relentless dread and deadly encounters. The deeper you go, the more your senses fail, your gear falters, your mind fractures\u2026 and terrifying enemies close in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871090/extras/58c0afb73e1878f1ea7a0fe50cbc3924.avif?t=1754644883\" width=616 height=162 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Dweller is a psychological survival horror game where you're trapped in a rotting sewer system with something watching your every move. You're low on resources, high on tension, and the only voice you hear might be trying to help... or mess with your head. Trust no one. Stay quiet. Stay alive.",
